    The object itself is referenced by this:MethodName(). When dealing with time
    in Lua, use os.time(). Your response is formatted as JSON as follows:'
  gameObjectInstructions: 'note that the methods are the only methods available for
    this object, do not come up with methods that dont exist. The Game Object you
    are writing code for is:'
